	'The protected store and the folder of the %1$s %2$s are not read as lying on one device of this server now, so it is not swapped: a unit is swapped only by renaming, which works on one device only. Ask the host to put the protected store on the device of wp-content, or update the unit by hand in wp-admin.',
	'The answer of the test requests before the swap of the %1$s %2$s does not read in the form AlphaBridge writes it, so it counts as not passed and the unit is not swapped. Call action=next again; where it keeps failing, update the unit by hand in wp-admin.',
	'The test requests before the swap of the %1$s %2$s did not reach every target this site has to answer before a swap (not reached: %3$s; home is the home page, mcp this MCP endpoint, admin_post wp-admin/admin-post.php), so the unit is not swapped. Let the site reach itself (wp_site_health shows the test requests), then call action=next again; or update the unit by hand in wp-admin.',
	'Something lies in the place of the %1$s %2$s on this site now, which the plan makes new here (code:live_changed), so it is not swapped. Make a new report (wp_site_diff) and plan again.',
