	'The %1$s %2$s on this site could not be read whole now (a file or folder not read, or the time of the call ran out), so whether it is still the version its pair is based on is not known and it is not swapped. Call action=next again; where it keeps failing, update it by hand in wp-admin.',
	'The files of the %1$s %2$s on this site are no longer the ones its pair is based on (code:live_changed), so it is not swapped, and the version of the staging site does not win over them. Where the plugin writes into its own folder while it runs, update it by hand in wp-admin; else make a new report (wp_site_diff) and plan again.',
	'The stage of the %1$s %2$s is not read as ready for this step (its state, its tree and hash, or its binding to this run, this unit and the version of the staging site), so it is not swapped. Call action=next again; where it keeps failing, abort the run (wp_site_push action=abort) and plan again.',
