	'The version of the %1$s %2$s could not be read from its head read whole on this site now, or the one of the staging site is no version, so whether the swap goes down a version is not known and it is not swapped. Make a new report (wp_site_diff) and plan again, or update it by hand in wp-admin.',
	'The staging site has an older version of the %1$s %2$s (%3$s) than this site (%4$s), and a swap never goes down a version. Update it on the staging site, take its environment over anew, make a new report (wp_site_diff) and plan again.',
	'This call has %3$s seconds left, and the swap of the %1$s %2$s needs %4$s from here (a margin of twice the test requests before it, which took %5$s seconds, and a reserve, kept for the swap), so it is not swapped in this call. Call action=next again; where it keeps failing, ask the host for a longer time limit of PHP (max_execution_time), or update the unit by hand in wp-admin.',
