	'The plan makes the %1$s %2$s new on this site, and WordPress names it as running here now (a main file of it in the option active_plugins, or the theme that runs or its parent), so what of it runs here is not known and it is not swapped. Check the plugins and the theme of this site in wp-admin (the page Plugins deactivates a plugin whose files are missing), then call action=next again; or abort the run (wp_site_push action=abort), make a new report (wp_site_diff) and plan again.',
	// includes/lifecycle/class-change-lock.php (Z8b branch 5, part 2a, decision of the lead on finding 4: the swap among the changes that hold the lock; it replaces the text without it).
