	// includes/class-protected-store.php (Z8b branch 5, R12 part 1: a reader under a deadline in a request that has not decided the store).
	'Where the protected store is was not decided yet in this request, and this reading has a time limit, so it does not decide it now (its check can take longer than the time left) and reads nothing of the store. Call again; where it keeps failing, report it to the makers of AlphaBridge MCP: the caller decides the store before such a reading.',
	// includes/sync/class-sync-code-swap.php (Z8b branch 5, part D1 of the rest: the swap in the run, F56; the swap of a unit made new refused, the refusals before the first rename, the ends of not_swapped(), unclear() and ended(), the answer of a swap done, OPcache and the close of the mark, the pair after the swap; code:probe_off and code:means replaced 1 for 1 in their place above, without a probe after the swap or a swap back; the text of the swap not connected to the run gone with it).
	'The plan makes the %1$s %2$s new on this site, and the swap of a unit made new is not part of this version, so nothing is swapped and nothing of this site changed. Abort the run (wp_site_push action=abort) and install the unit by hand in wp-admin.',
	'The folder of the %1$s %2$s on this site, its stage in the protected store, or which of its main files run, could not be read now (device and inode of a folder, or the option active_plugins), so it is not swapped and nothing of it was moved. Call action=next again; where it keeps failing, update the unit by hand in wp-admin.',
